{"id":"sh/l4bupwny","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 4","position":{"left":89.28,"top":194.88,"width":512.64,"height":396.48},"text":"初期版：首輪＋在宅中継機＋アプリ\n\n屋外：GNSS／SLASで測位し、\nLTE-Mで位置を送信する。\n室内・近距離：Bluetoothの受信を\n在宅の目安・探索に利用する。\n\n位置の取得時刻と電池残量も表示。\n音・光は飼い主が操作したときだけ。\n\n将来：IMUによる活動量の変化を記録。\n病気の診断は行わない。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/032tgr6d","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 5","position":{"left":643.2,"top":148.8,"width":563.52,"height":456},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/n6dcr65o","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 6","position":{"left":660.48,"top":160.32,"width":309.94,"height":26.88},"text":"利用の流れ","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/m5kbi1oj","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 7","position":{"left":660.48,"top":194.88,"width":528.96,"height":396.48},"text":"1. 首輪を充電し、アプリに登録する。\n\n2. 自宅の中継機をWi-Fiに接続する。\n\n3. 見当たらない時に在宅の目安と\n　 最終確認位置を確認する。\n\n4. 屋外では捜索モードで位置を更新。\n　 近づいたらBluetooth・音・光を使う。\n\n5. 発見後は履歴を振り返り、\n　 脱走しやすい場面の対策に生かす。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/4ji5kbid","kind":"textbox","name":"Slide Number Placeholder 0","position":{"left":1230,"top":684.48,"width":35,"height":24},"text":"5","style":{"fontSize":10.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#B5B5B5","alignment":"right"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/3i94r61s","kind":"textbox","name":"source-disclosure-5","position":{"left":74.88,"top":630,"width":1120,"height":40},"text":"携帯圏外では送信できない。在宅中継機の未受信だけで「脱走」と断定しない。","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
